# Pixel Art Integration

Adopt when importing or configuring visual assets.

**Import (pixel art):** filter=false, compress=lossless, mipmaps=false.
**Naming:** `[category]_[name]_[variant].png` → `assets/art/[category]/`
**Pipeline:** Receive → Name → Place → Import → Slice → Pivot → Z-order → Test at 320×180
**Readability:** Player >16px, distinct silhouettes, player vs enemy bullets different colors.
